1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Bilasizmi, O'zbekistonning eng mashhur qo'shiqchilaridan biri

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,600
ipak fabrikasi ishchilarining qizi bo'lgan.

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:09,200
Yulduz Usmonova Farg'ona viloyatidagi Marg'ilon shahrida tug'ilgan.

4
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,780
Uning ota-onasi ipak fabrikasida ishlagan.

5
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,260
O'zi esa Marg'ilondagi pedagogika institutida musiqa o'qigan.

6
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:19,800
Uning tug'ilgan sanasi 1963-yil 12-dekabr.

7
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:23,080
Katta sahnaga yo'li 1990-yilda boshlandi.

8
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:27,220
O'sha yili u Olmaotada o'tgan «Osiyo ovozi» xalqaro tanlovida

9
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,860
ikkinchi o'rinni qo'lga kiritdi.

10
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,760
Keyinchalik ingliz va o'zbek tillarida kuylangan

11
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:35,460
«I Wish You Were Here» qo'shig'i bir qancha Yevropa pop chartlarida

12
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,080
yuqori o'rinlarni egalladi.

13
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:40,780
Bu o'sha davrdagi o'zbek xonandasi uchun kutilmagan yutuq edi.

14
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,820
Ammo bu hali hammasi emas.

15
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:45,400
Yulduz Usmonova O'zbekiston (1995),

16
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:49,940
Qoraqalpog'iston (2000) xalq artisti unvonlariga ega.

17
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:54,160
Tojikiston, Turkmaniston va Qozog'istonda esa xizmat ko'rsatgan artist bo'lgan.

18
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:57,460
U Oliy Kengashda ikki muddat deputat bo'lib ishlagan.

19
00:00:57,520 --> 00:01:01,260
1991-yilda «Temir erkak» filmida rol ijro etgan.

20
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:03,980
Rossiyalik qo'shiqchi Maksim Fadeyev bilan birga

21
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:06,080
«Skaji mne imya» qo'shig'ini kuylagan.

22
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:08,720
Bugun esa uning iste'dodini qizi davom ettirmoqda.

23
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:10,940
Qizi Nilufar Usmonova ham qo'shiqchi.

24
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:13,840
Siz Yulduz opaning qaysi qo'shig'ini yaxshi ko'rasiz?

25
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:15,220
Izohlarda yozib qoldiring!
